{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZFunctorial","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZHexagonCentral","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Matrix"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.exp_intertwine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.exp_intertwine","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZIntertwine.lean#L115-L141","doc":"**`exp` intertwines.** If `T A = A' T` then `T e^{A} = e^{A'} T`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.Φ_intertwine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.Φ_intertwine","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZIntertwine.lean#L83-L113","doc":"**The associator intertwines.** If `T A = A' T` and `T B = B' T`, then\n`T Φ(A, B) = Φ(A', B') T`. Non-resonance is needed for the residues and for their block sums. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.blockDiag_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.blockDiag_apply","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZIntertwine.lean#L80-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.blockDiag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.blockDiag","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZIntertwine.lean#L64-L78","doc":"The block-diagonal embedding `End U × End U' → End(U ⊕ U')` (stated with the normed-ring\ninstances, so that `KZFunctorial.map_Φ` applies without an expensive instance unification). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.PR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.PR","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZIntertwine.lean#L60-L62","doc":"The product algebra `End U × End U'`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.Φ_prod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.Φ_prod","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZIntertwine.lean#L42-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.nonResonant_prod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZIntertwine.nonResonant_prod","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZIntertwine.lean#L34-L40","signatureChunk":0}]}